      "spam": false,
      "value": "I would like to leave a suggestion on how to implement this.\n\nAdd an option that if you double tab the center of the touchpad on the vive or double press a certain button on the rift an emote wheel like the one suggested above appears locally above the controller.  The wheel is divided into eight segments like a d pad.  \n\nYou can then press in the direction of one of the segments to activate the emote or toggle it on/off.  This does not act as a normal press of that direction.  If you want the wheel to go away then simple tap the center again or press the button.\n\nYou can have each hand have its own wheel thats an extra 16 emotes which a lot of people would find very useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
