  "details": "I got this inspiration from other video games like GTA V. The weapon wheel in the game makes it easier for players to choose weapons than before. It would be great if VRChat uses this UI design for Emotes/Emoji since it takes a lot of clicking just to use 1 emote/emoji. Assigned the wheel to a key and it would be easier for players to emote.",
